&CONTROL
    calculation = 'scf'
    prefix='sic',
    pseudo_dir = './',
    outdir='./'
    verbosity='high'
    forc_conv_thr = 1d-5,
    tprnfor = .true.
    tstress = .true.
/

&SYSTEM
    ibrav=  0,
    nat=  2, 
    ntyp= 2,
    ecutwfc = 86.0,
    ecutrho = 860.0,
    occupations = 'smearing', smearing = 'gaussian', degauss = 0.02,
/

&ELECTRONS
    diagonalization='david'
    mixing_mode = 'plain'
    mixing_beta = 0.7
    conv_thr =  1.0d-7
/


ATOMIC_SPECIES
Si  28.086  Si.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF
C   12.0107 C.pbe-n-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF

CELL_PARAMETERS (angstrom)
   0.000000000   2.229759320   2.229759320
   2.229759320   0.000000000   2.229759320
   2.229759320   2.229759320   0.000000000

ATOMIC_POSITIONS (crystal)
C        0.250000000   0.250000000   0.250000000
Si       0.000000000   0.000000000  -0.000000000

K_POINTS {automatic}
12 12  1  0 0 0

